        "original_id": "46b6ba7d-01fd-524f-885d-d328e6cf2914",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Louis Leterrier, Corey Yuen, Luc Besson\n- Works: The Transporter, Unleashed, The Incredible Hulk, Clash of the Titans, Now You See Me, The Hire\n- Roles: film director, artistic director, writer\n- Topics: French film, action thriller film\n\nFacts:\n- Louis Leterrier was born on June 17, 1973, and he is a French film director.\n- The Transporter is a 2002 English-language French action thriller film.\n- The Transporter was directed by Corey Yuen and Louis Leterrier, and Louis Leterrier was credited on the project as artistic director.\n- The Transporter was written by Luc Besson.\n- Luc Besson was inspired by BMW Films' The Hire series when writing The Transporter.\n- Louis Leterrier's films include the first two Transporter films, Unleashed (2005), The Incredible Hulk (2008), Clash of the Titans (2010), and Now You See Me (2013).",
